BT /F2 12 Tf 58.00 199.20 Td (How to shard your data?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 178.60 Td (When you decide to shard, you\222re really making two decisions that work together:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 158.70 Td (What to shard by \(the shard key\): This is the field/column you use to split the data \226 for example, user_id,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 145.30 Td (tenant_id, or country. It defines how the data is logically grouped.) Tj ET
