BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 487.04 Td (Without transactions, databases could end up in inconsistent states like money deducted from Account A, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 473.64 Td (not received in Account B \(Partial Updates\) or 2 people booking the last movie ticket at the same time \(Conflict.\)) Tj ET
