BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 358.49 Td (Transactions, Atomicity means:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 338.59 Td (All statements within a transaction takes effect or none meaning All statements within a transaction either take) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 325.19 Td (effect together or not at all. If even one query in the transaction fails, the entire transaction is rolled back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 305.29 Td (Say if you had\222nt implemented a Transaction and if you tried the same example of Sending 100$ to Account B.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 291.89 Td (And mid way as you update and send 100$ to account B, the PC faces some problem and shuts down.) Tj ET
